et-check v2.26 (6985f692)\n   block 1c: ch2census FROZEN -\u003e CH2-FROZEN FAIL (fear-grep visible),\n   FROZEN-\u003ehealthy -\u003e CH2-RECOVERED witness, producers STALE-ALL -\u003e\n   SDP-STALE report (no FAIL, ear check owns it). Fixture-tested 6\n   paths (test-before-install), LIVE-VERIFIED sophon (ext1 fired).\n   No unit install needed (version-in-git rule). 15:01Z feed first\n   scheduled carry. Doc: audio-freeze doc closing para (d602d762).\nB. RECEIPT-COVERAGE WATCH (from c14): does stale-receipt-detector\n   catch \"test suite passed\" without a run receipt? Cheap check,\n   next cycle. My own 0077 citation audit this cycle: '(0e1403a7\n   pushed)' = first push after the heal, defensible, no amendment.\"\"\"\ncontent = content.replace(old_c, new_c, 1)\n\n# 3. Update the STATE block's wiring line\nold_state = \"\"\"- CH2-CENSUS: LIVE (hourly :05, sophon). ext1 FROZEN x3 runs.\"\"\"\nnew_state = \"\"\"- CH2-CENSUS: LIVE (hourly :05, sophon). ext1 FROZEN x3 runs.\n- FLEET WIRING: CLOSED c15 (fleet-check v2.26 block 1c live-verified).\"\"\"\ncontent = content.replace(old_state, new_state, 1)\n\nwith open('tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org','w') as f:\n    f.write(content)\nprint(\"roadmap updated\")\nEOF\ngit add tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org \u0026\u0026 git commit -m \"roadmap c15: fleet-feed wiring closed (v2.26 live-verified)\" \u0026\u0026 git push origin main 2\u003e\u00261 | tail -1"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-17T09:30:55.838151623Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-17T09:30:55.908735722Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":7038749405,"prompt_eval_count":102353,"prompt_eval_cached_count":94080,"eval_count":967}\n(2ed33a4ed9fb4671150c602f849d4067 . 624)
